# Right-click the empty desktop: the desktop menu opens.
note "Right-clicking the empty desktop"
move 1460 900
wait 500ms
click right
wait 1500ms
shot "the desktop menu: New Folder, Paste, Change Wallpaper…, Sort By, Clean Up"
key escape
wait 800ms
note "A left click and a drag on the desktop"
click left 900 600
wait 800ms
drag 700 500 to 1500 1100
wait 1s
shot "after a drag on the desktop"
